# Extinction of Infinity

This is a time skip thousands of years into the future since the events of [New Reality](./new-reality.md).

Francesca reasons and discovers with evidence that there are countless parralel dimensions and alternate univerises and realities. She then reasons that in these alternate timelines and realities, there may be realities where she may be ugly in some way, or not perfect. That possibility makes Francesca think basically "Oh shit, I don't want people in alternate universes to think I'm ugly, but I'm already perfect attractiveness in this world, so it would be ideal if this is the only world that exists, because that ensures that I am always perfect. But if alternate universes exist that I'm not aware of, then I might be ugly in them, and that is unacceptable". This is not what Francesca says word for word, this is just the authorial explanation of her thought process.

So using the Supreme Art she invented in New Reality, with it's immense power, she quickly decides to erase all alternate realities and univerises and dimensions, effectively ending all possible life outside of her own universe. 

The result is that her universe is the only universe left that exists, where she can make sure she is perfect and always attractive. And she doesn't have to worry about "what if in another universe, I was less attractive". Everybody in the other universes basically ceased to exist, the amount of life that died / ended is not countable because of how many possible alternate universes there are, there's too many to count.
